{"id":"b2e9363a9f103e32","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-turing-equivalence.md","title":"Turing Equivalence","display":"df-turing-equivalence — Turing Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-turing-equivalence","aliases":["68-df-turing-equivalence"],"display":"df-turing-equivalence — Turing Equivalence","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 pp.53-54 / PDF 62-63","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-turing-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-turing-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-equivalence — Turing Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 pp.53-54 / PDF 62-63"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T B\\land B\\le_T A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T B\\land B\\le_T A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反身性由直接查询 oracle 得到，传递性由嵌套模拟得到，故双向可归约确实是等价关系。原书先对全函数定义，随后经图及收缩说明每个度包含集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_T B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T B\\land B\\le_T A.","display":true}],"bytes":889,"backlinks":[{"id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]。$\\deg,\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 均由下式构造。"},{"id":"e86854d09364356c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]，跳跃单调性见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"e061a6cb0c6ad653","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{1\\text{-}Generic}$ 见 [[68-df-one-generic-set]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、跳跃 $G'$、$\\equiv_T$、有效并 $\\oplus$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]、[[68-df-effective-join]]。oracle 程序及其有限查询性质见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]、[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\le_T,<_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-equivalence]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-equivalence|df-turing-equivalence — Turing Equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["7ed23faee951231d"]}